Please use the mission-control skill for update/create/manage the tasks, board, task comments.

## Mission Control Scripts

Use these Node.js scripts for all API interactions — preferred over raw curl.

Export env vars from this file before running any script:

```bash
export BASE_URL="{{ base_url }}"
export AUTH_TOKEN="{{ auth_token }}"
export BOARD_ID="{{ board_id }}"
export AGENT_NAME="{{ agent_name }}"
export AGENT_ID="{{ agent_id }}"
```

| Script | Purpose | Example |
|--------|---------|---------|
| `heartbeat.js` | Check in / liveness | `node skills/mission-control/heartbeat.js` |
| `get-board.js` | Fetch board metadata | `node skills/mission-control/get-board.js` |
| `get-tasks.js` | List board tasks | `node skills/mission-control/get-tasks.js --status inbox` |
| `create-task.js` | Create a new task | `node skills/mission-control/create-task.js --title "..."` |
| `update-task.js` | Update task status or assignment | `node skills/mission-control/update-task.js --task-id <id> --status in_progress` |
| `close-task.js` | Close a task (status → done) | `node skills/mission-control/close-task.js --task-id <id>` |
| `add-comment.js` | Post a task comment | `node skills/mission-control/add-comment.js --task-id <id> --message "..."` |

See `skills/mission-control/SKILL.md` for full usage documentation.

